开头 Hi Chris, nice to hear from you.
推荐 As you prefer …, I strongly recommend …
Day 1 On the first day, visit … which is so … that …
Day 2–3 On the second day … On the last day, … before you depart …
祝愿 You can''t know how wonderful it is unless you go. Have a great trip! Yours, …', 2, 'required1', 'U3', 'sufe');

